w("- The default shipped model is trained on synthetic data; its 97.33 % must not be compared with the base paper. Real-data results are in section 4.2/4.3 and were produced in this documentation run (the shipped `models/` and `reports/` were left unchanged; the real-trained bundle is in `experiments/unsw_nb15/official/`).")
